    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Glassbreakers Open Beta has Officially Closed</h1><p>The servers are currently offline as we transition into the next phase of development. Thanks for playing! <br><br>Stay updated on Glassbreakers development: </p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Lead your squad of Champions into an immersive arena in this exciting game of tactics, magic, and power! From the developers of the Game Awards\u2019 2022 VR/AR Game of the Year Moss: Book II, this 1v1 real-time battler puts you face to face with your opponent and their squad for action-packed gameplay that will keep you coming back for more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/a99b744d9efd6ee883ca789c577fd927.poster.avif?t=1705088862\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/a99b744d9efd6ee883ca789c577fd927.webm?t=1705088862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/a99b744d9efd6ee883ca789c577fd927.mp4?t=1705088862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Squad Up.</strong><br>Choose your combination of three Champions from a growing roster of the most heroic, villainous, and notorious inhabitants from the world of Moss. Each Champion has their own unique abilities that will complement the others in your squad and match up against the opposition in a myriad of consequential ways. Expansive customization sets ensure your squad's style is distinctly your own.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/634c4559c6aea68d579aa4efdfc8c621.poster.avif?t=1705088862\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/634c4559c6aea68d579aa4efdfc8c621.webm?t=1705088862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/634c4559c6aea68d579aa4efdfc8c621.mp4?t=1705088862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Face Off.</strong><br>Battle against friends in private games or match with similarly skilled players in the Glassbreakers community. Stay ready for anything as you never know which Champions your opponent will recruit for their squad. The immersive arena also presents the opportunity to observe the real-time physical movements of your opponent\u2014spot their strategy and take action to turn the tide in your favor.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/4f40c5e5c96c19ebd481a853c4c10c9e.poster.avif?t=1705088862\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/4f40c5e5c96c19ebd481a853c4c10c9e.webm?t=1705088862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/4f40c5e5c96c19ebd481a853c4c10c9e.mp4?t=1705088862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>And May the Glass Break Your Way.</strong><br>Reach into battle and direct your squad to attack opposing Champions and their Glass stronghold while also leveraging tactical elements to gain strategic advantages on the Board. Every match presents its own unique opportunities and challenges as ever-changing squad combinations and playstyles bring endless variety to gameplay. Optimize your strategy for the match at hand to ensure it\u2019s your squad that reigns victorious.",
    "about_the_game": "Lead your squad of Champions into an immersive arena in this exciting game of tactics, magic, and power! From the developers of the Game Awards\u2019 2022 VR/AR Game of the Year Moss: Book II, this 1v1 real-time battler puts you face to face with your opponent and their squad for action-packed gameplay that will keep you coming back for more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/a99b744d9efd6ee883ca789c577fd927.poster.avif?t=1705088862\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/a99b744d9efd6ee883ca789c577fd927.webm?t=1705088862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/a99b744d9efd6ee883ca789c577fd927.mp4?t=1705088862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Squad Up.</strong><br>Choose your combination of three Champions from a growing roster of the most heroic, villainous, and notorious inhabitants from the world of Moss. Each Champion has their own unique abilities that will complement the others in your squad and match up against the opposition in a myriad of consequential ways. Expansive customization sets ensure your squad's style is distinctly your own.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/634c4559c6aea68d579aa4efdfc8c621.poster.avif?t=1705088862\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/634c4559c6aea68d579aa4efdfc8c621.webm?t=1705088862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/extras/634c4559c6aea68d579aa4efdfc8c621.mp4?t=1705088862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><stron